{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through no fault of your own, you have been gifted (or perhaps cursed?) with a small plot of land abutting the ominous Roguemount. It is your task to turn this empty field under the ominous shadow of the mountain into a thriving economy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've constructed your Manor it is up to you (or rather, the serfs you've brought with you. Wouldn't want our Ruler getting their hands dirty!) to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore The Mines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather Resources</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attract new Units</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your fledgling Town!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903710?t=1753829314","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903710?t=1753829314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903710/56e11cdbf216ff96d6505eb6fb753935fc04d940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753829314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903710/56e11cdbf216ff96d6505eb6fb753935fc04d940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753829314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through no fault of your own, you have been gifted (or perhaps cursed?) with a small plot of land abutting the ominous Roguemount. It is your task to turn this empty field under the ominous shadow of the mountain into a thriving economy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've constructed your Manor it is up to you (or rather, the serfs you've brought with you. Wouldn't want our Ruler getting their hands dirty!) to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"